    step("大小限制:MAX_COOKIE_SIZE 默认 4093;设置 5000 字节的 cookie 时 Werkzeug 发出警告(「The 'big' cookie is too large: the value was 5000 bytes but the header required 12 extra bytes. The final size was 5012 bytes but the limit is 4093 by…」),响应仍然是 200、头照样发出 —— 只是警告,浏览器会丢弃超限的 cookie。", t=tl(S(6)), done=lidx(S(6), 'MAX_COOKIE_SIZE'), mark=lidx(S(6), '5000 字节'), kv=KV([['MAX_COOKIE_SIZE', '4093'], ['超限', '警告 + 仍然发送']], ['超限'])),
